# Phase Gates & QA

- Work **one phase at a time**. Never start the next phase without explicit user approval (`Approve`).
- After each phase: concise report + ask exactly whether to proceed to the next phase.
- If user says `Changes`, fix within the current phase and re-request approval.
- Prefer Vitest/RTL for units and Playwright for responsive/interaction when tests are in scope.
- No production deployment without separate explicit production-deployment approval.
- Frontend-first: mock form success until lead destination is approved.
